      "description": "<p>The Aspis enforcer slices their palm with a dagger, and the blade glows as it absorbs some of their blood. The glow spreads to the daggers of the enforcer's Aspis allies. For 1 round, all daggers wielded by the enforcer and allies within 30 feet of them deal an additional 3 poison damage.</p>\n<p>Effect: Prepare Fangs 3</p>",
